influencer.

00:00:29.404 --> 00:00:31.531
Really? I can’t even believe I
know her.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.576
-Mmm.
-Mmm.

00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:35.744
It tastes like booze.

00:00:35.744 --> 00:00:37.454
Yes I soaked it in brandy for a
month.

00:00:37.746 --> 00:00:40.374
Oh, we’re free, we’re free.

00:00:40.374 --> 00:00:41.833
-Oh my God that was awful.

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:43.126
That was awful.

00:00:43.126 --> 00:00:45.796
O'Theo Le garbage jata.

00:00:46.296 --> 00:00:48.548
Let’s go hit that cattle show!

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:50.550
(Cheering)

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:54.054
Hit the cattle show.
Cows, chickens.

00:00:55.222 --> 00:00:55.681
Mmm.

00:00:55.681 --> 00:00:57.266
Get up, Emily.

00:00:57.266 --> 00:00:58.100
No.

00:00:59.309 --> 00:01:02.396
Get up, Emily.
-Don’t make me goooo. ugh.

